From 40f2bbc131f4dcfb34375cbdd9e7ca7cb551e11c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:01:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Energy for WASM block entities (API block 3)

energy-spec/energy-side in the WIT, energy and faces in block-entity and
update, a pure per-tick transfer between neighbours (horizon_mods::energy,
tested), the game applying it to loaded block entities, harness support
(set-energy, block-energy) and the energy-demo example. Regenerated the API
reference.
